Package: dualguard-student
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-cryptography
Maintainer: DualGuard Project <noreply@dualguard.local>
Description: DualGuard-Student dual-AI risk control platform (student edition)
 DualGuard-Student blocks complete homework answers and full Scratch
 graphical build walkthroughs, emitting only knowledge points and partial
 logic explanations when content is intercepted.
 .
 Hard guarantees:
  * AES-encrypted violation records with HMAC tamper-proofing
  * Audit-file hash verification on startup with auto-restore from backup
  * Anti-system-clock-rollback via monotonic counter
  * Single violation popup; 3 cumulative violations lock dialog for 72h
  * Dual-layer audit: pre-audit AI gate + post-output reviewer (un-skippable)
  * Runs as a systemd background service with auto-start on boot
  * Fully decoupled from the security edition (isolated data dir)
